note Type a name in the 'new path' field of the top bar and press enter: a flow path with that name, authored by the human, is added to the map and opened, empty, in the document. The field clears. An invalid name or one that clashes is refused in the status bar; a name that already exists opens nothing new. Steps are then added with pin selection.

